text.section:
The aggregate amount of grants payable under this section shall not exceed $60,597,000. Grants are anticipated to be paid in 20 annual fiscal year installments, calculated in accordance with a memorandum of understanding, as follows:

$691,545, for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2026;


$1,558,800, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection, for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2027;


$3,423,813, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection, for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2028;


$4,553,857, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection, for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2029;


$6,928,781, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection, for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2030;


$11,147,397, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection, for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2031;


$15,084,768, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2032;


$19,253,760, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2033;


$22,699,410, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2034;


$26,145,060, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2035;


$29,590,710, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2036;


$33,036,360, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2037;


$36,482,010, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2038;


$39,927,660, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2039;


$43,373,310, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2040;


$46,818,960, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2041;


$50,264,610, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2042;


$53,710,260, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2043;


$57,155,910, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2044; and


$60,597,000, less the total amount of grants previously awarded pursuant to this subsection for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2045.
				In accordance with the memorandum of understanding, actual grant payment amounts and fiscal years may differ from the schedule in this subsection and may be extended beyond the fiscal year beginning July 1, 2045, but in no event shall the aggregate amount of grant payments across all fiscal years exceed $60,597,000. In addition, in no event shall grants be paid from the Fund for more than 20 consecutive years. Any grants not earned by the end of a 20-year payment period shall be forfeited.
